    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Jan 2022 04:07:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>--简介--</span></p><p><span>延吉作为东北网红打卡小城市，真的好好吃！三天带你吃不重样~作为延吉土著和新晋延吉人想给大家介绍一些美食，录制这期的时候我们的口水直流啊�冷面配锅包肉、五花肉配辣白菜、紫菜卷配年糕火锅！我们的时间轴就是菜单即视感～快来听听这期带声音的美食合集吧！</span><br><br><br><span>哦对了！这个冬天顺路去趟长白山滑雪也不错哦！</span><br><br></p><br><p><span>--TIMELINE--</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">2:22</a> 豆浆面</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">5:13</a> 苏子叶</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">7:41</a> 煎沙参</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">9:06</a> 樱菜</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="657">10:57</a> 辣白菜</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a> 牛板筋</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 酱杂菜</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> 冷面</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> 牛肥肠</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">32:03</a> 小菜</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1993">33:13</a> 山葱和五花肉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2449">40:49</a> 烧烤和烤肉不一样</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a> 火辣鸡爪真的好辣</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2763">46:03</a> 延吉的炸鸡也太卷了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3088">51:28</a> 参鸡汤大补</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3309">55:09</a> 松茸</span><br><br></p><p><span>--MUSIC--</span></p><p><span>片头曲白鲨JAWS - Dive Back In Time</span><br><span>片尾曲Muzaffer Ahmet - Humarig Bolay 爱你成瘾</span><br><br></p>]]></description>
